{"id": "EUVD-2026-96594", "enisaUuid": "ac200962-177d-379d-a579-be6647190114", "description": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the QuartzJobController queryById handler that allows low-privileged authenticated users to read scheduled job records. Attackers can request GET /sys/quartzJob/queryById with a job id to retrieve job class names, cron expressions, job parameters and status reserved for administrators.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T21:49:42", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T16:01:08", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/JeecgBoot/poc_record_query_by_id.py", "https://github.com/jeecgboot/JeecgBoot/blob/e3b9dc0aefe1943d9772b026f64ed671a7c82802/jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-biz/src/main/java/org/jeecg/modules/quartz/controller/QuartzJobController.java#L194-L198", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jeecgboot-through-3.9.5-missing-authorization-via-sys-quartzjob-querybyid"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108655", "GHSA-qq99-5fcw-r864"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "db546055-f9a3-3e71-afe2-95ce9330f3e8", "product": {"name": "JeecgBoot", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.9.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "cb9e413b-1a4a-3327-9306-7bc893f930fa", "vendor": {"name": "jeecgboot"}}], "isExploited": false}